{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nVienna is magnificent, even in the rain. The Emperor’s name day was marked by a full house at the Italian Opera. We sat through twenty-nine singers—Fodor, Rubini, among them—shouting the anthem in unison. It was a spectacle of noise rather than subtlety. The rain prevented the usual illuminations, so we missed the visual display, but the German premiere of Auber’s opera was a pleasant surprise. The crowd was spirited, if a bit loud.\n\nI have already sent my luggage off ahead of me. I feel light, ready to move on. Do not worry about the small things here; I am well. I miss your quiet presence in Berlin, but this travel has a certain invigorating quality. I hope the boys are well-behaved and that your health is sound. I shall write again soon from Prague.\n\nYours ever,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080290,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":195,"prompt_tokens":949,"total_tokens":1144,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-N7XuYwx6zlAiPZVUbPTAN7ffi7RJMRrD","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":949,"prompt_ms":894.632,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9427102212855637,"prompt_per_second":1060.771356267158,"predicted_n":195,"predicted_ms":4589.772,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.65861855670103,"predicted_per_second":42.2678947886736}}